From ee0445391ca41ade09a8c59ac4408cee2af84034 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: review <review@local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 09:35:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Record the new energy source tag defaults in NEWS, and
 guard the spin-up ratio

The offset is now required, the closure check runs by default without a
tolerance, and the closure and audit tables gain columns. NEWS.md says so,
and no longer claims that an unset offset is the default.

relative_since_spin_up now uses the same zero guard as the other ratios,
so a zero scale writes zero rather than NaN.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LA3FukgbRCMkra999BhdDw
